{
  "Enemies.Hel.Desc": "You are fighting a (literally) smoking hot salamander -- a seven foot tall woman with crimson scales covering her legs, back, and forearms, with a tail swishing menacingly behind her, ablaze with a red-hot fire. Her red hair whips wildly around her slender shoulders, occasionally flitting over her hefty E-cup breasts, only just concealed within a scale-covered bikini top. Bright red eyes focus on you from an almost-human face as she circles you, ready to close in for the kill. Her brutal, curved sword is raised to her side, feinting at you between genuine attacks."
  "Enemies.Hel.Name": "Hel"
}
